@page "/ethos"

<PageTitle>Ethos - Muhammad Kashif-Khan</PageTitle>

<section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
        <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
        <nav class="mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-gray-400">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Home</a>
                <span>/</span>
                <span class="text-white">Ethos</span>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ethos</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-400">My philosophy on technology, responsibility, and human-AI collaboration</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Responsibility and Sustainability -->
        <div class="mb-16">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-400 to-green-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-leaf text-white text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-400">Responsibility and Sustainability</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    For me, technology isn't just about solving problems — it's about doing so responsibly. As a Muslim, I take seriously the idea of preventing corruption on the earth, and that translates into how I think about my work: building systems that are sustainable, ethical, and genuinely useful.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                    I believe that what we create should improve lives without adding unnecessary complexity or harm.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Living with AI -->
        <div class="mb-16">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-cyan-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-robot text-white text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400">Living with AI, Not Competing Against It</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    AI is changing the way we code. Routine tasks that once took hours can now be handled in minutes. But I've also seen first-hand that the real challenge lies before the coding even begins — in the planning, the design, and the clear understanding of algorithms and workflows.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                    Whether I'm collaborating with an AI tool or with a team, the groundwork we put in is what determines success.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Human Skill Still Matters -->
        <div class="mb-16">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-purple-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-brain text-white text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-purple-400">Why Human Skill Still Matters</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Working in biotech projects has shown me the limits of AI. It can speed things up, but it can't handle every bug, every nuance, or every messy real-world problem. That's where human judgment still matters.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                    I've learned to step in where automation falls short — to diagnose, untangle, and see the bigger picture.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- My Approach -->
        <div class="mb-16">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 to-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-yellow-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-compass text-white text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400">My Approach</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    I see my role as going beyond what's expected of a "junior developer." My strength lies in combining technical skill with perspective: knowing when to trust the machine, when to question it, and how to design workflows that make the best of both worlds.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                    For me, coding isn't just about output — it's about clarity, responsibility, and impact.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="text-center">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-4">Ready to Collaborate?</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
                    If you're looking for a developer who combines technical expertise with ethical responsibility and thoughtful collaboration, I'd love to hear from you.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#projects" class="bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-gray-900 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
                        <i class="fas fa-rocket mr-2"></i>View My Work
                    </a>
                    <a href="/#contact" class="border border-cyan-500 text-cyan-400 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-gray-900 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope mr-2"></i>Get In Touch
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Back Button -->
        <div class="text-center mt-12 pb-8">
             <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i>Back to Home
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>